[{"r":6720,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":43,"p":null,"l":"","x":"alt=\"Diagram\" width=\"800\" height=\"56\">"},{"r":6721,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":44,"p":null,"l":"","x":"RV32I Arithmetic Instructions:"},{"r":6722,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":45,"p":null,"l":"","x":"| Instruction         | Effect                                           | Description            |\n|:--------------------|:-------------------------------------------------|:-----------------------|\n"},{"r":6723,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":46,"p":null,"l":"","x":"Addition and subtraction do not check for overflow and underflow.\n\nRV32I Control Instructions:\n\n| Instruction         | Efect                                        |                       |\n|:-------"},{"r":6724,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":47,"p":null,"l":"","x":"To allow flexible use of registers, the P0 compiler maintains a set `regs` of registers in use. For RISC-V, `GPregs` are the general-purpose registers:\n```python\nGPregs = {'s2','s3','s4','s5','s6','s7"},{"r":6725,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":48,"p":null,"l":"","x":"| E           | code(E)                                 | register | condition               |\n|:------------|:----------------------------------------|:---------|:------------------------|\n| `x`  | `"},{"r":6726,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":49,"p":null,"l":"","x":"| `+ E`       | `code(E)`   |  |\n| `– E`       | `code(E)`<br>`sub reg, zero, reg` | `reg` | `reg` is the register of `E`   |\n| $E_1 + E_2$   | `code(E₁)`<br>`code(E₂)`<br>`add reg, reg₁, reg₂` | `reg"},{"r":6727,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":50,"p":null,"l":"","x":"For boolean expression, the translation scheme is analogous, except that no code is generated for the negation of a relational operation, only the relation is negated:"},{"r":6728,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":51,"p":null,"l":"","x":"| E           | code(E)                                 | register | condition               |\n|:------------|:----------------------------------|:------|:------------------------|\n| `false`    | `add"},{"r":6729,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":52,"p":null,"l":"","x":"| $E_1 < E_2$<br>$not(E_1 \\ge E_2)$  | `code(E₁)`<br>`code(E₂)`<br>`slt reg, reg₁, reg₂`| `reg` | `reg₁` is the register of $E_1$ <br> `reg₂` is the register of $E_2$ <br> `reg` is a fresh register|\n|"},{"r":6730,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":53,"p":null,"l":"","x":"### Translation Scheme for Statements and Declarations\n\nThe translation scheme for P0 statements is:"},{"r":6731,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":54,"p":null,"l":"","x":"| S           | code(S)                                 | condition             |\n|:------------|:----------------------------------------|:------------------------|\n| `x := E`  | `code(E)`<br>`sw reg"},{"r":6732,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":55,"p":null,"l":"","x":"| $S_1; …; S_n$    | `code(S₁)` <br> `…` <br> `code(Sₙ)`                                  |                        |\n| `if E then S` | `code(E)`<br>`beq reg, zero, L1`<br>`L2:`<br>  ` code(S)`<br>`L1:"},{"r":6733,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":56,"p":null,"l":"","x":"The translation scheme for declarations is:\n\n| D                 | code(D)                             | effect                       |\n|:------------------|:------------------------------------|:----"},{"r":6734,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":57,"p":null,"l":"","x":"The translation scheme for a program is:\n\n| P                 | code(P)                             |  comment                  |\n|:------------------|:------------------------------------|:----------"},{"r":6735,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":58,"p":null,"l":"","x":"### Translation Scheme for Boolean Operators\n\nIn P0 boolean operators `and` and `or` evaluate conditionally:\n```pascal\np and q = if p then q else false\np or q = if p then true else q\n```\n\nThe followin"},{"r":6736,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":59,"p":null,"l":"","x":"The P0 compiler implements an improved scheme that does not store intermediate results but branches to the locations where execution is to be continued right away.\n\n### Translation Scheme for Arrays\n\n"},{"r":6737,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":60,"p":null,"l":"","x":"Local arrays are dynamically allocated in memory in a stack.\n\nWith $A = [l .. u] \\to T$, the translation scheme for programs with local array declarations is:\n\n| D          | code(D)          |    com"},{"r":6738,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":61,"p":null,"l":"","x":"For example:\n\n<code style=\"float:left;margin-left:2em\">\nvar i, j: integer\nvar x: [1..5] → integer\nprogram p\n    i := x[j + 3]\n</code>\n\n<pre style=\"float:left;margin-left:2em\">\n    .data\ni_:\t.space 4\nj"},{"r":6739,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":62,"p":null,"l":"","x":"<code style=\"float:left;margin-left:2em\">\nvar i, j: integer\nprogram p\n  var x: [1..5] → integer\n    i := x[j + 3]\n</code>\n\n<pre style=\"float:left;margin-left:2em\">\n\t.data\ni_:\t.space 4\nj_:\t.space 4\n\t.t"},{"r":6740,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":63,"p":null,"l":"","x":"| S           | code(S)                                 | comment |\n|:------------|:----------------------------------------|:--------|\n| `x[E] := F` | `code(E)`<br>`addi reg₁, reg₁, -x.lower`<br>`add"},{"r":6741,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":64,"p":null,"l":"","x":"For example:\n\n<code style=\"float:left;margin-left:2em\">\nvar i, j: integer\nvar x: [1..5] → integer\nprogram p\n    x[i + 3] := 7\n</code>\n\n<pre style=\"float:left;margin-left:2em\">\n\t.data\ni_:\t.space 4\nj_:\t"},{"r":6742,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":65,"p":null,"l":"","x":"<code style=\"float:left;margin-left:2em\">\nvar i, j: integer\nprogram p\n  var x: [1..5] → integer\n    x[i + 3] := 7\n</code>\n\n<pre style=\"float:left;margin-left:2em\">\n\t.data\ni_:\t.space 4\nj_:\t.space 4\n\t.t"},{"r":6743,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":66,"p":null,"l":"","x":"Pseudoinstruction            | Base Instruction(s)                                           | Meaning   | Comment\n:----------------------------|:------------------------------------------------------"},{"r":6744,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":67,"p":null,"l":"","x":"fs{w\\|d} rd, symbol, rt      | auipc rt, symbol[31:12]; fs{w\\|d} rd, symbol[11:0]\\(rt\\)      | Floating-point store global\nnop                          | addi x0, x0, 0                                "},{"r":6745,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":68,"p":null,"l":"","x":"seqz rd, rs                  | sltiu rd, rs, 1                                               | Set if = zero\nsnez rd, rs                  | sltu rd, x0, rs                                             "},{"r":6746,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":69,"p":null,"l":"","x":"bgt rs, rt, offset           | blt rt, rs, offset                                            | Branch if >\nble rs, rt, offset           | bge rt, rs, offset                                            "},{"r":6747,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":70,"p":null,"l":"","x":"* [1] We don't specify the code sequence when the B-extension is present, since B-extension still not ratified or frozen. We will specify the expansion sequence once it's frozen."},{"r":6748,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":71,"p":null,"l":"","x":"<img"},{"r":6749,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":72,"p":null,"l":"","x":"src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyBjbGFzcz0nV2F2ZURyb20nIGhlaWdodD0nNTYnIHByZXNlcnZlQXNwZWN0UmF0aW89J3hNaWRZTWlkIG1lZXQnIHZpZXdCb3g9JzAgMCA4MDAgNTYnIHdpZHRoPSc4MDAnIHhtbG5zPSdodHRwOi8vd3d3LnczLm9yZ"},{"r":6750,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":73,"p":null,"l":"","x":"cm09J3RyYW5zbGF0ZSg0LDIxKSc+PGcgc3Ryb2tlPSdibGFjaycgc3Ryb2tlLWxpbmVjYXA9J3JvdW5kJyBzdHJva2Utd2lkdGg9JzEnPjxsaW5lIHgyPSc3MTUnLz48bGluZSB5Mj0nMzEnLz48bGluZSB4Mj0nNzE1JyB5MT0nMzEnIHkyPSczMScvPjxsaW5lIHgx"},{"r":6751,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":74,"p":null,"l":"","x":"PSc2NzAnIHgyPSc2NzAnIHkxPSczMScgeTI9JzI4Jy8+PGxpbmUgeDE9JzY0OCcgeDI9JzY0OCcgeTI9JzMnLz48bGluZSB4MT0nNjQ4JyB4Mj0nNjQ4JyB5MT0nMzEnIHkyPScyOCcvPjxsaW5lIHgxPSc2MjYnIHgyPSc2MjYnIHkyPSczJy8+PGxpbmUgeDE9JzYy"},{"r":6752,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":75,"p":null,"l":"","x":"ZSB4MT0nNTgxJyB4Mj0nNTgxJyB5MT0nMzEnIHkyPScyOCcvPjxsaW5lIHgxPSc1NTknIHgyPSc1NTknIHkyPSczMScvPjxsaW5lIHgxPSc1MzYnIHgyPSc1MzYnIHkyPSczJy8+PGxpbmUgeDE9JzUzNicgeDI9JzUzNicgeTE9JzMxJyB5Mj0nMjgnLz48bGluZSB4"},{"r":6753,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":76,"p":null,"l":"","x":"PjxsaW5lIHgxPSc0NjknIHgyPSc0NjknIHkyPSczJy8+PGxpbmUgeDE9JzQ2OScgeDI9JzQ2OScgeTE9JzMxJyB5Mj0nMjgnLz48bGluZSB4MT0nNDQ3JyB4Mj0nNDQ3JyB5Mj0nMzEnLz48bGluZSB4MT0nNDI1JyB4Mj0nNDI1JyB5Mj0nMycvPjxsaW5lIHgxPSc0"},{"r":6754,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":77,"p":null,"l":"","x":"aW5lIHgxPSczNTgnIHgyPSczNTgnIHkyPSczJy8+PGxpbmUgeDE9JzM1OCcgeDI9JzM1OCcgeTE9JzMxJyB5Mj0nMjgnLz48bGluZSB4MT0nMzM1JyB4Mj0nMzM1JyB5Mj0nMycvPjxsaW5lIHgxPSczMzUnIHgyPSczMzUnIHkxPSczMScgeTI9JzI4Jy8+PGxpbmUg"},{"r":6755,"d":1417,"s":"note","t":"8 A RISC Architecture as Target","c":78,"p":nu